# X MRR Banner Generation Specification

Generate one complete, publication-ready X profile banner using the exact business data supplied below.

The result must already contain all visible text, financial values, store indicators, status UI, decorative artwork, and the progress bar.

Real app icons and the attribution watermark are added programmatically AFTER image generation.

For app icons only, generate solid pure-red chroma markers using {{ icon_marker_hex }}. These markers will later be detected and replaced with the real app icons.

Do not leave any other placeholders visible.

Do not add any content that is not explicitly requested in this specification.

## Canvas

- Width: {{ banner.width }} px
- Height: {{ banner.height }} px
- Aspect ratio: {{ banner.aspect_ratio }}
- Platform: X profile banner
- Compose specifically for a wide 3:1 banner.
- Use approximately 4% safe margins from the outer edges.
- Keep all important text and UI comfortably inside the safe area.
- Do not place critical text against the extreme top or bottom edges.
- Preserve enough breathing room around every major content block.

## Context

The following information provides context for the challenge.

Do NOT render these values unless they are explicitly included in the Visible Content section.

- Challenge headline: {{ challenge.headline }}
- Start date: {{ challenge.start_date }}
- Deadline: {{ challenge.deadline }}
- Current period: {{ challenge.current_period }}
- Total periods: {{ challenge.total_periods }}
- Target MRR: {{ challenge.target_mrr_formatted }}
- Current MRR: {{ revenue.current_mrr_formatted }}
- Progress toward target: {{ revenue.target_progress_percent }}%

